    "section": "3.1 胡牌来源",
    "fromLine": 170,
    "toLine": 170,
    "text": "胡牌来源-杠上开花：杠后补牌自摸，按自摸计算",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-048",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.1 胡牌来源",
    "fromLine": 171,
    "toLine": 171,
    "text": "胡牌来源-点炮：进张为他人打出的牌，不按自摸计算",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-049",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.1 胡牌来源",
    "fromLine": 172,
    "toLine": 172,
    "text": "胡牌来源-抢杠胡：进张为他人补杠的那张牌，不按自摸计算",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-050",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.2 进张",
    "fromLine": 175,
    "toLine": 177,
    "text": "进张定义：自摸为本次摸到的牌；点炮为他人打出的牌；抢杠胡为被抢的补杠牌",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-051",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.3 财神与财神计数",
    "fromLine": 180,
    "toLine": 180,
    "text": "实际财神：白板财神时为白板；翻财神时为翻出的那张牌",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-052",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.3 财神与财神计数",
    "fromLine": 181,
    "toLine": 181,
    "text": "替代牌：翻财神且实际财神不是白板时，白板登记为替代牌，参与胡牌拆解；白板本身仍是箭牌",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-053",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.3 财神与财神计数",
    "fromLine": 182,
    "toLine": 182,
    "text": "手牌财神数：手牌中的实际财神数 + 进张为实际财神时 +1",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-054",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.3 财神与财神计数",
    "fromLine": 183,
    "toLine": 183,
    "text": "财神总数：手牌财神数 + 本座位出牌区已打出的实际财神数",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-055",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.3 财神与财神计数",
    "fromLine": 184,
    "toLine": 184,
    "text": "财神不能用于吃、碰、杠的凑牌，只能用于胡牌拆解与听牌判断",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-056",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.4 敲响（万能听）",
    "fromLine": 187,
    "toLine": 187,
    "text": "敲响判定对象：进张前的手牌 + 副露 + 财神",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-057",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.4 敲响（万能听）",
    "fromLine": 188,
    "toLine": 188,
    "text": "敲响判定方法：枚举所有拆牌方案，只要存在一种方案的等待牌包含“任意牌”，即为敲响",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-058",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.4 敲响（万能听）",
    "fromLine": 189,
    "toLine": 189,
    "text": "无财神时必然不敲响",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-059",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.4 敲响（万能听）",
    "fromLine": 190,
    "toLine": 190,
    "text": "打出财神后是否敲响用于更新飘等级；爆头、财飘系列按自摸、飘等级和进张与财神成将判定，未额外强制检查敲响；是否要求实际胡牌必须敲响【待确认】",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-060",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.5 杠链",
    "fromLine": 193,
    "toLine": 193,
    "text": "每次杠（明杠、暗杠、补杠）杠链 +1；暗杠额外记录“含暗杠”标记",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-061",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.5 杠链",
    "fromLine": 194,
    "toLine": 194,
    "text": "打出非财神 → 杠链清零、暗杠标记清零",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-062",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.5 杠链",
    "fromLine": 195,
    "toLine": 195,
    "text": "打出财神且不敲响 → 杠链清零、暗杠标记清零",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-063",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.5 杠链",
    "fromLine": 196,
    "toLine": 196,
    "text": "打出财神且敲响 → 杠链保留",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-064",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.5 杠链",
    "fromLine": 197,
    "toLine": 197,
    "text": "吃、碰 → 杠链清零、暗杠标记清零",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-065",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/杭州麻将产品需求文档PRD.md",
    "section": "3.5 杠链",
    "fromLine": 198,
    "toLine": 198,
    "text": "杠链用于杠开系列番型",
    "mandatory": true
  }
]
